{"3989790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cranked", "steam_appid": 3989790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cranked is the dream project of a small team of riders and developers, including members of the original crew behind Mad Skills Motocross and Mad Skills BMX. It’s a downhill mountain bike game built to capture what it really feels like to ride—the speed, the flow, and the satisfaction of control—paired with the obsessive pursuit of the perfect run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Makes Cranked Different </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun-First Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice is guided by a single question: does it make the game more fun? No microtransactions, no exploitative hooks—just a focus on delivering awesome fun and real value. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Responsive Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The “free-whip” system gives you full command of bike handling and style, with no canned animations getting in the way. Cranked has a heavy focus on technical riding, line choice, and capturing the essence of real-world trails. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Global Racing Competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push yourself against players worldwide on constantly updated leaderboards, with instant restarts that fuel mastery and the hunt for that perfect run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open-Mountain Freedom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast landscape of trails, hidden paths, shortcuts, and easter eggs at your own pace.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modding as a Pillar</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modding isn’t an extra feature; it’s a non-negotiable pillar of Cranked’s design. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cranked is the dream project of a small team of riders and developers, including members of the original crew behind Mad Skills Motocross and Mad Skills BMX. It’s a downhill mountain bike game built to capture what it really feels like to ride—the speed, the flow, and the satisfaction of control—paired with the obsessive pursuit of the perfect run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Makes Cranked Different </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun-First Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice is guided by a single question: does it make the game more fun? No microtransactions, no exploitative hooks—just a focus on delivering awesome fun and real value. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Responsive Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The “free-whip” system gives you full command of bike handling and style, with no canned animations getting in the way. Cranked has a heavy focus on technical riding, line choice, and capturing the essence of real-world trails. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Global Racing Competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push yourself against players worldwide on constantly updated leaderboards, with instant restarts that fuel mastery and the hunt for that perfect run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open-Mountain Freedom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast landscape of trails, hidden paths, shortcuts, and easter eggs at your own pace.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modding as a Pillar</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modding isn’t an extra feature; it’s a non-negotiable pillar of Cranked’s design. </p>", "short_description": "Chase the top of the leaderboards in Cranked and experience the raw thrill of downhill mountain bike racing. It’s fast, responsive, and grounded -- we're chasing what it really feels like to ride. Easy to pick up, impossible to put down, and packed with virtually endless skill depth.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989790/cffc89f44135dab0aa8a68c0932af5069756ad26/header.jpg?t=1788293555", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989790/49ada625bf